                            <comment id="16383274" author="vsisko" created="Fri, 2 Mar 2018 07:00:54 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fixed showing of user activity details.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Added missing activities,&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Valid activity name with random part of link&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Sort by usage count.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

</comment>
                            <comment id="16383375" author="pkonstantinov" created="Fri, 2 Mar 2018 09:09:43 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Tested&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16385560" author="kuaw26" created="Mon, 5 Mar 2018 03:55:30 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Lets return to this issue after &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5466&quot; title=&quot;Web Console: New Configuration Screen&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-5466&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-5466&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; will be merged.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16571195" author="vsisko" created="Tue, 7 Aug 2018 07:06:23 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Implemented saving of user activity on state change.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To test new user should be created. Some old activities does not have valid string presentation.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16611786" author="pkonstantinov" created="Wed, 12 Sep 2018 09:04:44 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I noticed some minor UI issue in this modal, could you please fix it&lt;br/&gt;
 &lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/12939377/12939377_screenshot-1.png&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16617293" author="vsisko" created="Mon, 17 Sep 2018 09:28:30 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Merged last master. Increased width of dialog.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16618413" author="pkonstantinov" created="Tue, 18 Sep 2018 02:56:43 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I found some activities with a random URL still exists&lt;br/&gt;
 &lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/12940117/12940117_screenshot-2.png&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16621739" author="vsisko" created="Thu, 20 Sep 2018 09:39:34 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Failed to reproduce. Please provide the steps to reproduce after creation of a new user.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16631668" author="pkonstantinov" created="Fri, 28 Sep 2018 10:24:13 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Still reproduced. Ping me for help.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16679324" author="pkonstantinov" created="Thu, 8 Nov 2018 06:02:06 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I was wrong. Works right in case of a new user.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16687453" author="kuaw26" created="Thu, 15 Nov 2018 04:06:56 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Looks good to me. Merged to master.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16693018" author="pkonstantinov" created="Tue, 20 Nov 2018 10:31:58 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Re-tested in master&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
